# shellcheck shell=bash
# Invocation behind output/evaluation/determinism/determinism_repeat.json,
# determinism_seeds.json and gpu.txt, and behind l40s_8781724/ beside them.
#
# Job 8554985, 2026-08-12, on an NVIDIA H100 NVL (gpu.txt). Its log reads
# "Suite: ami  Model: openai/whisper-large-v3", "Subset: first 200
# utterances", "Seeds: 0 1 (each run 2 times)". Four decodes ran
# (seed0_run1/2, seed1_run1/2); determinism_repeat.json compares seed 0's two
# runs and determinism_seeds.json compares run 1 of seeds 0 and 1, so
# seed1_run2 was decoded but not compared. The job recorded no code commit;
# the ARC clone's reflog puts its HEAD at 754594d from 16:08:27 to 16:27:03
# BST, around the job's 16:11:56 to 16:25:04, but cannot say whether the
# tree was clean. submit_determinism.sh now repeats only the first seed, so a
# reproduction runs three decodes (seed0_run1/2, seed1_run1): the same files
# are compared, and the unused seed1_run2 is no longer made.
#
# The script's default DET_SEEDS="0 1 2" does NOT reproduce this artefact.
#
# Job 8781724 (determinism_gpu, 2026-09-12, an NVIDIA L40S, HEAD 1bb68ba by
# the reflog) ran with the same values and the default report directory, so
# on ARC it wrote over this run's files in
# $DATA/.../output/evaluation/determinism/. The top-level committed copies
# are the August run's. 8781724's summaries, gpu.txt and WER report are
# committed in output/evaluation/determinism/l40s_8781724/, and
# determinism_cross_accelerator.json compares its hypotheses, which stay in
# that ARC directory, with the August run and the V100 sweep.
#
# Reproduce (from the repository root on ARC):
#   ( set -a; . hpc/runs/determinism.env || exit 1; set +a
#     sbatch --account=educ-intract hpc/submit_determinism.sh )
#
# The job writes into $REPORT_DIR/determinism/. REPORT_DIR below sends a
# reproduction to repro/determinism/, so it cannot overwrite job 8781724's
# files; submit_determinism.sh also refuses to overwrite an earlier run's
# results unless OVERWRITE=1. The original used the default
# ${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation.
DET_SUITE=ami
DET_LIMIT=200
DET_SEEDS="0 1"
DET_REPEATS=2
REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/repro"
